Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, more details about the new Star Trek film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《星际迷航》最新电影的内容
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:07.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's going to be a scene depicting Spock's birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:07.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会讨论到斯波克出生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:11.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd be more interested in a scene depicting Spock's conception.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:11.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对斯波克母亲受孕那一幕比较感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:17.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please. For Vulcans, mating, or, if you will, Pon farr...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:17.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 对瓦肯人来说交配或是他们所谓的庞发…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:20.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...it's an extremely private matter. -I'd like to know the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:20.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是非常私人的事情 -我想知道细节的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:23.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His mother was human. His father was Vulcan. They couldn't conceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:23.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他母亲是地球人、父亲是瓦肯人 不可能怀孕的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:27.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe they had to go to a clinic. Can you imagine Spock's dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:27.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搞不好他们去诊所做人工受孕 你能想象斯波克的父亲…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:31.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a copy of Pointy Ears and Shapely Rears?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:31.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带着《尖耳翘臀》色情周刊进诊所吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:35.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How come on Star Trek everybody's private parts are the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:35.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么《星舰迷航记》里面 每个人的私处都长得一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No alien lady ever told Captain Kirk, "Hey, get your thing out of my nose."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都没有女外星人跟柯克舰长说 “把你那东西从我鼻子上拿开”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKS ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以帮我一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was writing an e-mail and the A key got stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在写电子邮件 结果A键卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now it's just going, "Aaaah."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:51.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What'd you spill on it? -Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:51.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-电脑上洒了什么东西？ -没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:53.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Diet Coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:53.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}健怡可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:56.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And yogurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:56.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有酸奶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:58.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And a little nail polish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:58.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一点指甲油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:00.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:00.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:02.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, switching to local nerd news...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:02.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 据书呆子新闻指出…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:06.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Fishman, Chen, Chaudury and McNair aren't fielding a team...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:06.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}费雪曼、陈、查德利跟麦克奈尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:08.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in the Physics Bowl this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:08.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今年不组队参加物理联赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:11.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're kidding. Why not? -They formed a barbershop quartet...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:11.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的？为什么？ -他们组了一个四重唱…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:14.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and got a gig playing Knott's Berry Farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:14.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要去诺氏果园表演
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:19.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow. So in your world, you're like the cool guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:19.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以在你们的世界里 你们是比较酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Recognize.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is our year. With those guys out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今年我们赢定了 那些家伙不参赛…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the entire Physics Bowl will kneel before Zod.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}物理联赛中所有人都得臣服在查德大帝手中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:31.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Zod? -Kryptonian villain. Long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-查德大帝？ -他是氪星的坏人 说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很棒的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.68,0:01:38.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Count me out. -What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.68,0:01:38.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不去 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:42.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want me to use my intelligence in a tawdry competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:42.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我这种绝顶聪明的人去参加那种无聊小比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:46.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you ask Picasso to play Pictionary?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:46.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会叫毕加索去玩画图猜谜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you ask Noah Webster to play Boggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会叫诺亚韦伯斯特玩猜字游戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you ask Jacques Cousteau to play Go Fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是叫雅克库斯托去玩钓鱼游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, you need a four-person team. We're four people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是一队要有四个成员 我们一个都不能少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.91,0:01:59.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By that reasoning we should also play bridge, hold up a huppah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.91,0:01:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}四个人也可以玩桥牌 搭犹太婚礼的彩棚…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and enter the Olympic bobsled competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还可以去参加奥运雪橇赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.21,0:02:05.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tickets to that, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.21,0:02:05.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请给我门票
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:10.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what? Do I need to quote Spock's dying words to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:10.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 要我念出斯波克死前遗言吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:11.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:14.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"The needs of the many--"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:14.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“大众的需求
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:16.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Outweigh the needs of the few--"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:16.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凌驾于少数人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:18.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Or the one."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:18.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或个人需求之上”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:20.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:20.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:48.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, first order of Physics Bowl business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:48.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}参加物理联赛的首要任务
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need a truly kick-ass team name. Suggestions?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得取个响亮的队名 有什么建议吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:56.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about the Perpetual Motion Squad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:56.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}永恒运动队？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.47,0:03:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's beyond the laws of physics, plus a little heads up for the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.47,0:03:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是物理定律 又可以给女士们一点暗示
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:03.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-The ladies? -Perpetual Motion Squad...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:03.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-女士？ -永恒运动队…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:06.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we can go all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:06.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}代表我们很持久啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:08.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I like it. -I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:08.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这名字我喜欢 -我不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Teams are traditionally named after fierce creatures...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常大家会用凶猛的怪兽命名…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:13.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...thus intimidating one's opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样才能吓到敌队
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could be the Bengal Tigers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以叫做孟加拉虎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Poor choice. Gram for gram...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个名字太烂了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:21.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...no animal exceeds the relative fighting strength of the army ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:21.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有动物的战斗能力能比得上兵蚁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe so, but you can't incinerate a Bengal tiger with a magnifying glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许吧 但太阳下用放大镜却烧不死孟加拉虎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's put it to a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}投票决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-All those in favor-- -Point of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-赞成… -我有程序性问题要提出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:35.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I move that any vote on team names be unanimous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:35.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我提议采取不记名投票
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:38.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No man should be forced to emblazon his chest with a Bengal tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:38.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不喜欢老虎…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:41.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when common sense dictates it should be an army ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:41.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}觉得应该是兵蚁的人 不应该被迫投给老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:45.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will the gentleman from the great state of denial yield for a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:45.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这位死不认错的先生愿意让别人说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I will yield. -After we go through the exercise...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我愿意 -在我们投票之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:51.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of an annoying series of votes, which the gentleman will lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:51.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这位先生输了以后…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...does he intend to quit if he does not get his way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果不如他所愿 他会退出吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:57.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He does. -We are the Army Ants. All those in favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:57.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他会的 -我们是兵蚁队 还有谁赞成？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good afternoon and welcome to today's Physics Bowl practice round.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}午安 欢迎参加物理联赛练习赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:05.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Penny, and I'll be your host because...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:05.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是佩妮 比赛的主持人…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:08.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I didn't have anything else to do on a Saturday afternoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:08.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我在周六下午没其他事做…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:11.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and isn't that just a little sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:11.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样好像有点可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:14.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Gentlemen, are you ready? LEONARD: Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:14.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-各位准备好了吗？ -好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Fire away. -It's none of my business...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-开始吧 -我是不该多管闲事…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:20.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but is a guy who can't speak in front of women gonna hold you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:20.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过一个不敢在女士面前说话的人会拖累你们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:23.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, he'll be okay once the women are mixed into the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:23.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要女士们跟大伙混在一起就没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He only has a problem when they're one-on-one and smell nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只有单独跟身上有香味的女士相处时才会害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:29.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, thanks, Raj. It's vanilla oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:29.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你 拉吉 我擦的是香草精油
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:32.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was actually the one who noticed. Okay, let's just start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:32.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实是我注意到的 开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, the first question is on the topic of optics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 第一个问题 跟光学有关
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:37.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"What is the shortest light pulse ever produced?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:39.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“请说出最短的光脉”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:38.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BUZZER SOUNDS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:42.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Cooper. -Of course, the answer is 130 attoseconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:42.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-库珀博士 -130阿秒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:44.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That is correct. -I knew that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:44.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-答对了 -这我也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:48.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for you, sweetie. Okay, next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:48.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真棒 亲爱的 下一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:52.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"What is the quantum-mechanical effect used to encode data on hard-disk drives?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:52.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“量子力学用在硬盘解读数据会产生什么效果？”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BUZZER SOUNDS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard? -The answer is giant magnetoresistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德？ -巨磁电阻效应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:59.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Right. -Hey, I buzzed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:59.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-答对了 -是我按的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I answered. It's called teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮你回答了啊 这就是团队合作的精神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.35,0:05:07.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you think I should answer engineering questions? I am an engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.35,0:05:07.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得我该回答工程方面的问题吗？ 我可是个工程师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:12.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By that logic, I should answer anthropology questions because I'm a mammal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:12.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我该回答人类学的问题因为我是哺乳类动物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:15.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just ask another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:15.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续发问吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.19,0:05:21.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"What artificial satellite has seen glimpses of Einstein's predicted 'frame dragging'?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.19,0:05:21.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“哪种人造卫星可以探测 爱因斯坦的结构拖曳效应？”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:22.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BUZZER SOUNDS]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重力探测卫星B
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:24.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, of course, it's Gravity Probe B.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, you have to let somebody else answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你得让别人回答问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:30.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Because it's polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:30.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -这样才有礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:34.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do manners have to do with it? This is war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:34.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这跟礼貌有什么关系？这可是一场恶战呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:37.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Were the Romans polite when they salted Carthage...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:37.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗马人毁灭迦太基…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to make sure nothing would ever grow again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在土地上洒盐让作物无法生长时 他们很礼貌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:44.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, you said I only had to ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:44.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你说我只要负责发问就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The objective is to give correct answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点是回答出正确答案
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I know them, why shouldn't I give them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我知道答案 为什么不能说？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:53.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some of us might have the correct answers too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:53.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们也可能知道答案啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:55.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Please. You don't even have a Ph.D. -All right, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:55.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拜托 你又没有博士学位 -够了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard, sit down. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 坐下 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:02.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We should take a little break. -Good idea. I need my wrist brace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:02.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-休息一下好了 -好啊 我要去拿护腕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:06.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All this button pushing is aggravating my old Nintendo injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:06.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一直按按钮害我之前打任天堂的旧伤又开始痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.41,0:06:07.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERS INDISTINCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:08.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:08.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:09.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:09.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He compared Sheldon to a disposable feminine cleansing product...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说谢尔顿就像抛弃式女性清洁用品…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...one might use on a summer's eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以用在私密处
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and the bag it came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 还有袋子可以装着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, excellent. I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 太好了 快过来看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:30.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can it wait? I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:30.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以等一下吗？我有事要跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:34.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just look. I've designed the perfect uniforms for our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:34.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看一下就好 我设计了超棒的队服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The colors are based on Star Trek: The Original Series.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}队服的颜色是依照《星际迷航》设计的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The three of you will wear support red and I will wear command gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们三个是红色的 我是队长 穿金色的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:43.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do they say "AA"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:43.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么上面写了“AA”？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Army Ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}兵蚁的英文缩写
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:50.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't that confusing? AA might mean something else to certain people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:50.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样会让人搞不清楚吧？AA有可能是别的意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:55.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would a Physics Bowl team be called Anodized Aluminum?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:55.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会有人把队名取成电镀铝吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I meant--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是啦 我是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:06:59.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:06:59.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:01.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:01.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got you a Batman cookie jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我买了蝙蝠侠饼干桶给你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:08.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, neat. What's the occasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:08.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真棒 为什么送我礼物？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:11.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you're a friend and you like Batman and cookies...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:11.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你是我的朋友啊 而且你喜欢蝙蝠侠跟饼干…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you're off the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有 你被小队开除了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:17.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:17.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:20.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, Raj and I just had a team meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:20.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德、拉吉跟我开了小队会议
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.32,0:07:22.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You didn't. -We did. I just came from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.32,0:07:22.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不可能 -是真的 我刚开完会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know where you just came from. It couldn't have been a team meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不管你从哪回来 绝对不可能是去开小队会议
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:30.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm on the team and I wasn't there. Ergo, the team did not meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:30.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是小队成员 我没去开会 所以你们没开会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:33.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let me try it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:33.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我这样说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:36.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was at a coffee klatch with a couple of friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:36.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟几个朋友一起喝咖啡…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and one thing led to another and, it turns out, you're off the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们聊天聊到后来 决定你被开除了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:44.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Because you're taking all the fun out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:44.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -因为你让整个比赛变得很无趣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, is the winner of the Physics Bowl the team that has the most fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赢了物理联赛不是最有趣的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Let me try it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我这样说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:54.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're annoying and no one wants to play with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:54.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很惹人烦 没有人想跟你在同一队
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:57.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:57.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:04.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, at this point I should inform you that I intend to form my own team...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:04.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然这样 我要自己组队…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:07.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and destroy the molecular bonds that bind your very matter together...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:07.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毁灭你们的队伍…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:11.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and reduce the resulting particulate chaos to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:11.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你们欲哭无泪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:15.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for the heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:15.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的告知
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-One more thing. -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:20.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还有 -什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:22.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's on, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:22.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的竞争就此开始 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So who did he get to be on his team? -He won't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他的队员有谁啊？ -他不说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:37.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He just smiles and eats macaroons out of his Bat-Jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:37.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只是一边笑一边吃着蝙蝠侠盒子里的蛋白饼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's using psychological warfare. We must reply in kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在跟我们打心理战 我们一定要笑脸回应
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:45.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I say we wait until he looks at us, then laugh like:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:45.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该等到他抬头看我们 然后我们对他微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:47.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Yes, you are a smart and strong competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:47.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“你的确是强硬的对手…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:49.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we are also smart and strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:49.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们也聪明绝顶…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and we have a reasonable chance of defeating you."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很有可能打败你”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:56.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How exactly would that laugh go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:56.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要怎么笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hee-hee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That sounds more like:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这听起来更像是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"We are a tall, thin woman who wants to make a coat out of your dalmatians."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“我们是又高又瘦的女人 要把你的斑点狗拿来做大衣”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:13.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, let's remember that Sheldon is still our friend and my roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:13.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 别忘了谢尔顿还是我们的朋友和我的室友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:17.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So nothing. Let's destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:17.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 让我们摧毁他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:19.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:20.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:22.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: Hee-hee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:29.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, we're gonna need a strong fourth for our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:29.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得找个厉害角色加入
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:33.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know who is apparently very smart is the girl who played TV's Blossom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:33.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《花开团圆》剧集里那个女士看起来很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She got a Ph.D. in neuroscience or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她好像是神经学博士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.83,0:09:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, we're not getting TV's Blossom to join our Physics Bowl team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.83,0:09:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 我们不要《花开团圆》的演员加入我们的小队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about the girl from The Wonder Years?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《两小无猜》里的那个女士呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:51.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, I believe I've found the solution to all our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:51.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我相信我找到解决方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't ask Leslie Winkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能找莱丝丽温克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.68,0:09:57.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Because you slept together...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.68,0:09:57.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？因为你跟她上床…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:01.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and when she was done with you, she discarded you like last night's chutney?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她腻了之后 就把你狠狠地抛弃了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You gotta take one for the team. -Yeah. Sack up, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你得为整个团队着想 -对啊 带点种吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:17.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here I go, taking one for the team...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:17.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为了全队着想…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in the sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带点种
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Leslie. -Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 莱丝丽 -嗨 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ahem. So, Leslie, I have a question for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱丝丽 我有个请求…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:31.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and it might be a little awkward, you know, given that I--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:31.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个请求有点怪 因为我们之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hit that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快说重点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:40.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no reason to feel uncomfortable because we've seen each other's faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:40.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我们看过彼此的脸蛋 还有四肢交缠的裸体…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:43.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and naked bodies contorted in the sweet agony of coitus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:43.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不需要因此感到尴尬的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:49.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's not? Gee, because it sure sounds like there should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:49.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？听起来超尴尬的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:53.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any aspects of our sexual relationship, regarding your preferences...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:53.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你所有的性癖好…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:57.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...your idiosyncrasies, your performance, are protected by the inherent...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:57.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}性习性跟床上的表现…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:00.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...confidentiality of the bedroom. -That's all very comforting...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:00.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我都会保密的 -听到这个消息真让人安心…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I'd like to get on my question now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我的请求还没说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:06.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Proceed. -We are entering the Physics Bowl...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:06.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-请说 -我们要参加物理联赛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...and we need a fourth. -No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还需要一名队员 -我不要参加 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:12.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm really busy with my like-sign dilepton supersymmetry search.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:12.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我忙着研究素轻子的超对称
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:15.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dilepton shmylepton, we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:15.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}科学小姐 我们需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:17.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:17.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.89,0:11:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.89,0:11:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们努力过了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:24.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll just have to face Sheldon mano y mano y mano a mano.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:24.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只好手牵手对抗谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, you're going up against Sheldon Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 你们的对手是谢尔顿库珀？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:29.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -That arrogant, misogynistic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:29.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是啊 -那个自大、瞧不起女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:33.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...doorknob that told me I should abandon my work with high-energy particles...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:33.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫我放弃高能量粒子学研究…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:36.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for laundry and childbearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:36.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回家洗衣带小孩的烂人？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她加入了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: So how do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们现在感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:47.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice and loose? Come to play? Got your game face on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:47.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轻轻松松？摩拳擦掌？拭目以待了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you ready? ALL: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-准备好了吗？ -当然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. You don't have to stay for the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你不需要陪我们的 -我想来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, no, I want to. Sounds really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:56.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:03.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（物理联赛）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:05.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Gentlemen. -Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:05.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-各位好 -谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon. -Hee-hee-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just gonna sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要坐下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:20.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So is that your team?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:20.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是你的队伍吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:22.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I don't need a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:22.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不需要队员
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could easily defeat you single-handedly, but the rules require four.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:26.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一个人就可以打败所有人 可是规定一队要有四人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So may I introduce the third-floor janitor, the lady from the lunch room and--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我的队员包括三楼清洁工、午餐大妈跟…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:35.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My Spanish is not good. --either her son or her butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:35.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的西班牙文不好 应该是她儿子或肉贩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what about your team?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:40.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What rat have you recruited to the S.S. Sinking Ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:40.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们找了哪个输家啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:42.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LESLIE: Hello, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:42.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好啊 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:46.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leslie Winkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:46.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱丝丽温克
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, Leslie Winkle. The answer to the question:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我是莱丝丽温克 就是那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:51.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Who made Sheldon Cooper cry like a little girl?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:51.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让谢尔顿库珀哭得像小女孩一样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:56.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, well, I'm polymerized tree sap, and you're an inorganic adhesive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:56.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是聚合树液 你是黏着剂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:13:00.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So whatever verbal projectile you launch in my direction is reflected off of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:13:00.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你朝我发射的口头攻击…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...returns on its original trajectory, and adheres to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都会弹回去黏在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:10.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, if everyone could please take your seats?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:10.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请各位就坐好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.01,0:13:20.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's your T-shirt.
